; Botched! map resource
; id: turretworks-01
; name: Turret Works
; description: G2-B playtest: one charging laser turret (Y1) in the middle, claimed by stepping on either P1 pad.
; players: 2-4
;
; Y1 charges for two ticks and fires on the third (so once per round), at the nearest robot within two tiles
; north, east, south or west of it; a wall stops the shot. Dispenser G1 sits one tile north of Y1, so
; grabbing its crate is a gamble. Stepping onto a P1 pad (left and right of the arena, both out of range)
; claims the turret; the other pad lets a rival take it back without resetting the charge. Hits on opponents
; score for the owner (+1, +3 more for a disable); neutral or self-inflicted damage scores nothing.
; The wall at (5,6) shortens the southern shot; walls at (2,2), (8,2), (2,6), (8,6) give cover.
